  "historyNote": "#6806, eff 7-18-98 (formerly Lab 508.06); ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07 New. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
